      "writtenOn": "2023-04-05T19:31:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Maciej, yes, \"do not merge\" is to prevent merging to tm-mainline-prod. The reason is the code for the tool of resource shrinker is not in tm-mainline-prod, which means the build will fail in tm-mainline-prod for the building system doesn\u0027t understand `shrink_resources: true`.",
      "parentUuid": "1aceaa74_cad464cc",
      "revId": "799d96734a6904122689c490de391d2ff049a36d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
